  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, whisk together cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, and lemon juice.",
    "2. Add the Syrian steak cubes and mix to coat.",
    "3. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes or up to 2 hours.",
    "4. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "5. Thread the marinated steak, tomatoes, onion, and garlic onto skewers.",
    "6. Brush the skewers with olive oil and season with salt.",
    "7. Grill for 8-10 minutes per side, or until the steak reaches 130°F - 135°F.",
    "8. Let the kebabs rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "9. Serve hot with your favorite sides, such as basmati rice or naan bread."
